  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Make dressing: Bring a small saucepan of water to the boil for the eggs. Bring a medium saucepan of water to the boil for the noodles. Peel and finely grate the ginger. Grate or finely chop 1 garlic clove. Trim and thinly slice the radish. Thinly slice the avocado, discarding the skin and stone.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/67014/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_01-3c5e09c19014ea60abcdf05ac61091d4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook noodles: Cook 2 eggs in the pan of boiling water for 7 mins, for soft-boiled or 8 mins, for hard-boiled. Drain, then cool in cold water. Peel and quarter the eggs.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/67015/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_02-2926580d9bbc8c56d65fa9aea6b809f9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice avocado: Cook 2 bundles of the noodles (the remaining noodles won't be used in this dish) in the pan of boiling water for 1-2 mins until tender. Drain and rinse under cold running water to prevent the noodles sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/67016/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_03-a49ec27f5bf99ddf4ba0511d16af9859.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice radish: Put the ginger, garlic, 2 tbs soy sauce, 1 tbs balsamic vinegar, 1 tbs vegetable oil, 1 tsp honey and half the sesame seeds in a large bowl and stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/67017/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_04-bc759d4f4e2c78354fd94ba1a59b85a9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Add the noodles, radish and spinach to the dressing and toss well to combine. Divide the noodle salad among bowls, top with the avocado and egg. Scatter with the remaining sesame seeds and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/67018/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_05-5a7a1690f603c65ff6737795493d279d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: For extra fruity zing, zest and juice half a lime and add to the dressing, omitting the balsamic vinegar. Or for crunch, add thinly sliced carrot with the radish.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/67019/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_HACK-4d24763fbe97269c0089cc30f420a7fa.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
